sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Writer
    participant BFF as Next.js BFF
    participant PP as pdf-parse
    participant CK as Chunker
    participant DB as Database
    participant F as FastAPI RAG
    participant Emb as GeminiEmbedder
    participant VS as PgvectorStore

    U->>BFF: drag PDF into Library
    BFF->>BFF: store Pdf row (parseStatus=queued)
    BFF->>PP: extractText(buffer)
    PP-->>BFF: rawText
    BFF->>CK: chunk(rawText, ~500 tokens)
    CK-->>BFF: chunks[]
    BFF->>DB: insert PdfChunk rows (verbatim ids)
    BFF->>DB: update Pdf.parseStatus=ready
    BFF->>F: POST /api/rag/ingest {projectId, chunks}
    F->>Emb: embedDocuments(chunks)
    Note over Emb: taskType = RETRIEVAL_DOCUMENT
    Emb-->>F: vectors[]
    F->>VS: store(vectors, chunkIds, projectId)
    VS->>DB: UPDATE embedding = vector WHERE id = chunkId
    F-->>BFF: ingested count
    BFF-->>U: PDF ready for RAG verification
